This directory contains R-code and data to produce all of the numerical results.
Specifically, 

table1.r and table2.r produce the results in tables 1 and 2

figure1.r and figure2.r produce figures 1 and 2

The code in "ppnetwork.r" must be run before running figure2.r.
The files "image..." contain the results of running ppnetwork.r,
and can be loaded by figure2.r if one wants to avoid running ppnetwork.r.




